</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib20" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Jahan et al. (2022)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Md Saroar Jahan, Mainul Haque, Nabil Arhab, and Mourad Oussalah. 2022.

</span>
