<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Prompts</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the instructions used to generate prompts for all three tasks in Listings <a href="#LST1" title="Listing 1 ‣ Appendix B Prompts ‣ LLM-Based Multi-Task Bangla Hate Speech Detection: Type, Severity, and Target… WARNING: This paper contains examples which may be disturbing to the reader" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, <a href="#LST2" title="Listing 2 ‣ Appendix B Prompts ‣ LLM-Based Multi-Task Bangla Hate Speech Detection: Type, Severity, and Target… WARNING: This paper contains examples which may be disturbing to the reader" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, and <a href="#LST3" title="Listing 3 ‣ Appendix B Prompts ‣ LLM-Based Multi-Task Bangla Hate Speech Detection: Type, Severity, and Target… WARNING: This paper contains examples which may be disturbing to the reader" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. Additionally, the prompts employed for zero-shot learning, fine-tuning, and inference are presented in Listing <a href="#LST4" title="Listing 4 ‣ Appendix B Prompts ‣ LLM-Based Multi-Task Bangla Hate Speech Detection: Type, Severity, and Target… WARNING: This paper contains examples which may be disturbing to the reader" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST1" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
